#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:5 004f11a297fe45669f1be36a342f4d06
msgid "Manual Tuning of Sub"
msgstr "水下机器人手动调参"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:7 cf8ce92b2dd34f98929451dca0124794
msgid ""
"Sub has several control mechanisms for axis stabilization in certain modes, "
"manuvering speeds, angle limits, etc."
msgstr "水下机器人在特定模式下具有多种轴向稳定、机动速度、角度限制等控制机制。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:10 965ee1731fc04086a8b4052cd7b2ccbd
msgid "Axis Stabilization"
msgstr "轴向稳定"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:12 92cf35f0efe842e09792f22a3a3bd75d
msgid ""
"Manual tuning may be required to provide maximum stabilization without "
"oscillation in the Roll,Pitch, and Yaw axes. Depending on frame "
"configuration and mode, Sub can provide attitude/heading stabilization in "
"those axes, but tuning of their attitude controllers may be required to "
"obtain the optimum stabilization, ie. rapid approach to rate/angle targets "
"with minimal overshoot or oscillation)."
msgstr ""
"可能需要手动调参，以在横滚、俯仰和偏航轴上实现最大稳定性且无振荡。根据机架配置和飞行模式，水下机器人可在这些轴上提供姿态/航向稳定，但可能需要调整其姿态控制器参数以获得最佳稳定性（即以最小超调和振荡快速逼近速率/角度目标）。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:14 7c979d6af18b46a9a4fb2874c1a327c5
msgid ""
"This can be accomplished by manually adjusting each axis' attitude rate and "
"angle controllers' parameter values."
msgstr "可通过手动调整各轴姿态速率和角度控制器的参数值来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:16 c5063c09c4d44949b6df06c1544cb671
msgid "The following rate controller parameters are adjusted:"
msgstr "需调整以下速率控制器参数："

